    "General \"AI in use\" disclosure",
    "Customer interaction disclosure (e.g., chatbots / GenAI)",
    "AI-assisted decision support disclosure",
    "AI-influenced decision disclosure",
    "Adverse action / explanation enhancements",
    "AI-generated content labeling"
  ],
